OL,5,G1000 Nightmare Tenants, Slum Landlords
OL,6,     FIn Bristol, cameras film every
OL,7,     Fstep of Britain's property
OL,8,     Fmeltdowns as landlords and tenants
OL,9,     Ffight it out.
OL,10,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,11,     FDerbyshire's road crime team
OL,12,     Flaunch a crackdown on drugs supply
OL,13,     Flines, using intelligence and
OL,14,     Fsurveillance tactics. Operation
OL,15,     FSpacedust targets county line
OL,16,     Fnetworks.
OL,17,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,18,     FDerbyshire's finest face a series
OL,19,     Fof issues with motorcyclists -
OL,20,     Fwith one evading them for over an
OL,21,     Fhour in a high-speed chase.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
