OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FA look at officers from
OL,7,     FDerbyshire's road teams facing the
OL,8,     Fdaily challenges of policing our
OL,9,     Fstreets whilst single crewed.
OL,10,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FDan Brigginshaw is kept on his
OL,12,     Ftoes when a suspect does a runner
OL,13,     Fand a routine vehicle check turns
OL,14,     Finto a drug bust for Suzie
OL,15,     FRanyard.
OL,16,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FA foul-mouthed pensioner pushes
OL,18,     FBarry's patience to the limit, and
OL,19,     FSarah Capes gives a bad boy biker
OL,20,     Fan early birthday present.
