OL,5,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FThe work of a major hospital
OL,7,     Ftrauma unit. Ian is rushed in
OL,8,     Fafter suffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,9,     FKen is flown to the hospital by
OL,10,     Fhelicopter after falling from a
OL,11,     Froof onto a skip.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FA 69-year-old fisherman is brought
OL,14,     Finto resus helicopter after an
OL,15,     Faccident out at sea; a man is
OL,16,     Fbleeding in his brain after being
OL,17,     Fhit with a lorry.
